Package: ttsandsttp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libasound2, wtype | libxdo-dev, dbus
Description: Text-to-Speech and Speech-to-Text service with DBus interface
 A Rust CLI application implementing Text-to-Speech (TTS) and Speech-to-Text
 (STT) functionality using sherpa-rs, with DBus daemon mode support.
 .
 Features:
  - Automatic model download and management
  - DBus interface for remote method calls
  - Support for multiple languages
  - Keyboard typing integration for STT results

